Linus,

please pull yet another sound fixes for v3.1-rc1 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

This contains only small fixes (some for regressions), and a few
snd-hdspm driver updates, which are local and safe to apply.


Thanks!

Takashi

